- detach_task_profile destination: removes candidate_task_profile_linked destination, adds route_task_profile_available. After this, route_task_profile_available true (since we detached). Good.

- attach_task_profile origin: adds candidate_task_profile_linked origin, removes route_task_profile_available (so becomes false). Good.

- confirm_candidate_preparedness origin: adds candidate_prepared origin.

- activate_origin_node: adds origin_node_ready.

- load_origin_payload: adds origin_node_occupied, origin_availability_locked, origin_payload_linked, removes cargo_available. After this, cargo_available false.

- unload_origin_payload: adds origin_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, cargo_available, removes origin_payload_linked. Does not affect origin_node_occupied or origin_availability_locked. So after unload, origin_node_occupied true, origin_node_ready true, origin_availability_locked true, origin_availability_confirmed true, cargo_available true. Good.

- assemble_transport_leg: adds transport_leg_assembled, transport_leg_origin_linked, transport_leg_destination_linked, removes transport_leg_available. After this, transport_leg_available false (goal does not require it). Good.

- authorize_transport_leg_loading: adds transport_leg_loading_authorized. No negative effects.

